The Menagerie is a city said to wander the Horizon, known from bedtime stories rather than from any chart. In the stories a party from [[Geography/Istria/index|Istria]] found it and came home to build the striders after it, great cities that carry their people across the worlds on legs. The Menagerie gathers wonders from the worlds it passes.

The [[Phenomena/Void Atlas|void atlas]] marks it as Menagerie 1, a few days past the first tithe voidward of the [[Org/The Harlequins/Providence|Providence]]. A city that moves should have no fixed place on a map, so its appearance on the chart is noted for that as much as for the possibility that the tale is true.
